@LoopedIn.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5114

# The public endpoints. Each *_ping reports 200 when its dependency is configured and 503 with
# the reason when it is not, so this file doubles as a configuration checklist.
# Protected routes (/me, /documents/*) need a real Clerk bearer token and are easier to exercise
# through the web UI at /me and /documents.

GET {{LoopedIn.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain

###

GET {{LoopedIn.Api_HostAddress}}/db/ping
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{LoopedIn.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/ping
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{LoopedIn.Api_HostAddress}}/documents/ping
Accept: application/json

###
